  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multiprofile RNA-only models with scvi_n200 encoder achieve higher accuracy (0.6501) than singleprofile baselines. However, the impact of aggregation methods (avgpool vs transformer) in multiprofile settings remains untested. This experiment tests whether replacing avgpool with transformer aggregation in the scvi_n200 multiprofile RNA-only model improves performance, isolating the effect of aggregation while keeping other factors constant. This addresses uncertainty about aggregation's role and builds on the strong multiprofile baseline (config_005)."
}

